      "text": "EPC staff report (Oct 20, 2021): five-story, 91-unit condominium building over one level of underground parking on a vacant 1.15-acre lot in the East Whisman Precise Plan Village Center area; units 697 to 1,594 sq ft. Proposed FAR 2.46 against a 1.0 FAR base; staff recommended the EPC recommend Council deny the project and vesting tentative map. City found the application complete on August 19, 2021.",
